  "originalText": "[Code Name] Surtr\n[Gender] Female\n[Combat Experience] 2 Years\n[Place of Birth] Unknown\n[Date of Birth] Jan 22\n[Race] Sarkaz\n[Height] 162cm\n[Infection Status] \nConfirmed Infected by medical examination.",
